sh pumped of 140m3 (after batch#4), 1000l/min - 145bar. Stopped injection</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-09-26T16:15:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-09-26T16:30:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">15</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- perforate</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>POOH w/ perforation BHA (run#22) from 146 m to 15 m</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-09-26T16:30:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-09-26T17:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- perforate</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>L/D  perforation BHA (run#22). All shots fired</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-09-26T17:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-09-26T17:15:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- other</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Performed Pre-job Meeting to P/U EZSV assembly (run#23)</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-09-26T17:15:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-09-26T18:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">3</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- mechanical plug</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>P/U EZSV assembly (run#23)</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-09-26T18:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-09-26T19:45:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">845</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- other</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>P/U 2x 3m pup joints and 1x 1.5m pup joint for spaceout and RIH w/ EZSV assembly to 845m. Average running speed 480m/hour</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-09-26T19:45:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-09-26T20:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">845</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- cement plug</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>M/U side entry sub assembly</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-09-26T20:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-09-26T20:45:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">855</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- mechanical plug</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>M/U TDS and recorded weights up/down 98t/91t. Washed setting area w/ L/min. Set EZSV plug at 855,3m, tagged plug w/ 10t and keep 10t weight on EZSV</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-09-26T20:45:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-09-26T21:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">855</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- cement plug</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Closed UPR, confirmed line up through the choke and MGS</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-09-26T21:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-09-26T22:45:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">855</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- cement plug</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Pumped 10m3 Hi-vis pill at 900l/min - 14bar, continued to displace C-annulus to sea water, staged up pumps to 1700l/min - 38bar. Max gas 2,6%, 1-2 ppm H2S in fluid. Oil base mud in returns initially and sea water towards the end. Totally sea water pumped of 1,4x BU</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-09-26T22:45:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-09-26T23:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">855</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- cement plug</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Opened UPR and closed choke, flow checked the well. Stable. Meanwhile held TBT before cement job</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-09-26T23:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-09-26T23:15:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">855</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- cement plug</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Connected cement hose and LT valve</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-09-26T23:15:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-09-27T00:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">855</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- cement plug</witsml